              "value": "Focus Gaze"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(arcane, concentrate, incapacitation, transmutation, visual)\n\nThe medusa fixes their glare at a creature they can see within 30 feet. The target must immediately attempt a Fortitude save against the medusa's petrifying gaze. If the creature was already slowed by petrifying gaze before attempting its save, a failed save causes it to be petrified permanently. After attempting its save, the creature is then temporarily immune until the start of the medusa's next turn."
